  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.0: Target .NET 11 and .NET 10 alongside .NET Framework 4.7.2-4.8.1; add synchronous SingleThreadedApartmentTask.Run, StaApartmentScope, ThreadAffinity, ThreadCultureScope and SetThreadLocale hygiene, ValueTask and cooperative TimeoutAfterAsync, MaxStackSize, Action overloads, native STA verification, CreateThreadScope, post-item message draining, and win-x86 floating-point mask hygiene.",
